{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_02_end","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_02","title":"呼嘯守衛","storyCode":"MN-2","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"eb71c9598736422a1f1bd68466f964ff8cc13de40cd46e8d724c0b9d313667c7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 2下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"各位！各位！各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在競賽開始之前，誰能預料到這個結果——聲名遠揚的臨光家族與塑膠騎士的對決，誰能想到會是這個結果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭·臨光！這個繼承了臨光之名的小女孩，竟然——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"被瑟奇亞克完全壓制！毫——無——還——手——之——力——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣可不行啊！臨光！為了這個名字，你知道在座的觀眾押了多少錢嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，什麼？看賠率其實並不高？喂，你們倒是對臨光抱點信任啊！這張臉不值錢嗎！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"又是佐菲婭又是耀騎士的，結果你就這點本事嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"讓人失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是呼嘯騎士團的老將，利用人造地形和速度優勢，我們可憐的小馬駒無處可逃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"再度停步！再度射擊！再度轉移！這就是“塑膠節奏”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（根、根本看不見他的動作！為什麼？明明還沒有佐菲婭的動作快——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（他停下了，得格擋——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"太慢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——瑪莉婭！左邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"什——嗚！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克，踩著牆壁做出了完美的連續射擊！哎呀，如果發生了當場擊斃的意外，可就要掐掉直播了啊，好險好險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到這身自開賽至今被命中數次卻完全沒有損耗的堅固護甲，竟然還能允許人做出如此輕便的動作！真令人驚訝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了嗎！這就是呼嘯守衛的最新產品！Jack2特殊高性能塑化凝膠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"這種搶手貨誰人不愛！？但也不要擔心，現在競技場前台正在派發九五折優惠券！機不可失時不再來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是......臨光？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，她真的是那個耀騎士的妹妹嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼，失望了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我怎麼會因為這種事情失望。倒是你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我？哎呀......再觀望觀望嘛，反正都買了票了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭這裡的感覺......莫布還是老樣子那麼讓人不爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便煽動一下這些人的情緒就會像浪濤一樣起伏......還有廣告，這種廣告真有人會去買？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"會有的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟讓人放下思考隨波逐流，不正是這個“騎士競技”最擅長的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，看那邊，離賽場最近的觀眾席。“鞭刃”的佐菲婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"不止。那邊還有幾個......都是小有名氣的騎士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":".......還有大概十分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"你運氣真不錯，如果不用拖延時間——你早就已經跪地求饒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"退場吧，臨光家的小女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"你不清楚這裡的規矩，直到你的四肢都被我的箭矢貫穿為止，裁判是不會喊停的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要這樣，放棄吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不能放棄......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"敬酒不吃吃罰酒......你除了眼神和她很像，簡直一無是處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"那好吧......看看你還能撐多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_courtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實戰和訓練是不同的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟沒有人會在這麼平坦的地方，講究禮貌地和你正面對決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況每個選手的裝備、武器、作戰風格，每一次都截然不同的地形、陷阱、場外支援道具......都會影響勝負。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"情報收集感覺很重要啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，問題也就在這裡，你沒法在這麼短的時間裡一個個記住每個卡西米爾騎士的弱點，但每個人也許都是盯著你來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士競技不存在萬金油的戰術，不過真要說有什麼通用解法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"揚長避短——或者說，全力以赴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃.......簡單來說就是，沒有辦法？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去觀察，思考。辦法這種東西，從來不是在面臨困難之前就能準備萬全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能在極短的時間裡分析情況，做出應有的判斷並反應，你以為這很簡單嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——左邊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"僥倖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"哦哦！？這是小臨光第一次做出的反擊——不，只是擋下了瑟奇亞克的佯攻算不上反擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"投票數並沒有變化！瑟奇亞克依舊擁有——碾壓性的——優勢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"觀察。思考。\n瑪莉婭——\n你有一雙天馬的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（騎士護甲——Jack2？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼嘯守衛十三種產品裡沒有這個樣式的——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......想以守待攻？愚蠢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"箭矢拖曳著些許煙塵，從瑪莉婭的髮絲間穿過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（動力增強，不，是更誇張的......可這個樣式......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......試試看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"衝鋒！像是木樁一樣被“塑膠”瑟奇亞克耍得團團轉的小臨光，第一次發起了衝鋒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"避開了裂隙的火焰與人造的冰霜，靈活，非常靈活——但是瑟奇亞克面不改色地站在原地！是打算正面決出勝負嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有弩手和劍盾騎士正面決戰的道理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"別想跑——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪都不跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"交錯的刹那，箭矢的呼嘯，臉頰上的刺痛，瑪莉婭並沒有出劍。\n她按著敵人的肩甲騰空而起，瑟奇亞克並沒有預料到這次衝鋒會如此“友善”——\n手掌感受得到的溫度，低聲的轟鳴，不自然的煙霧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？怎麼！？誰能想到我們不僅能看到騎士競技，甚至能在這裡看到雜技表演！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭終於得以近身瑟奇亞克，但卻未出一劍！這算是小臨光的挑釁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是沒出劍，是沒法出劍，不避開的話，現在左臂已經報廢了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塑膠玩具在拖延時間，為了靠節目效果獲得贊助......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才......做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"真燙啊......瑟奇亞克先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呼嘯守衛公司沒有為你的新裝甲考慮散熱問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......這是騎士工匠該關心的事，不是兩個身處賽場的騎士要談論的話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（高性能，輕盈......是維多利亞頂級工藝的仿製，還有哥倫比亞的源石強化骨骼內襯科技......之類的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（因為某些技術難題......不，也許只是為了美觀才放棄了散熱口......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（既然如此，極限還有——多久？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（轉移——射擊——轉移——射擊，就算知道行動模式也追不上他的速度。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（不對，是轉移、停步、射擊......等等？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然經歷了小小的插曲，但是雙方都已經重整旗鼓！拉開距離，節奏再度回到——等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭沒有猶豫！她在第一時間起步追上了瑟奇亞克的腳步！但是！但是速度依舊有差距！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......死纏爛打，速度劣勢的時候最忌追逐，“鞭刃”沒教過你嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個漂亮的頓步，轉身，瑟奇亞克在吐納間就已經上好了弓弦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（現在！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"光芒！突然出現的光芒充斥著賽場——這裡向大家額外推銷一下雷神開拓者系列的全新墨鏡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（什麼？競品廣告？只要投了錢誰管這個！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有攻擊——什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒有射擊，也沒有移動！再來！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"擋下了！！作為弩手的瑟奇亞克依舊毫無負擔地擋下了瑪莉婭的全力一擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"小臨光，瑪莉婭，完全無計可施！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（果然！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"法術居然只是虛晃一招......這有什麼意義？那才是你最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克先生，強制冷卻系統真的適合在賽場上使用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就能發現還真是讓人驚訝......也許你更適合當個工匠，而不是騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——瑟奇亞克先生，您是一位很強的騎士，速度、技巧都無可指摘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"但很遺憾，看來您似乎選擇成為了企業的產品測試員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"......這與你無關，不要小看了呼嘯守衛的技術力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——是嗎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦！？瑪莉婭竟然主動拉開了距離，這是為什麼！？剛才兩人說了什麼悄悄話！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"觀眾們想必也很好奇，我早就說過了應該給騎士們配上麥克風——誰不想聽聽他們撂狠話的內容呢！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦，開始滿場亂竄了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭·臨光......她好像發現了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我看也是。也行吧，比起單純的力氣勝負，本來咱們騎士就該多花點腦子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"盡耍小聰明......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"停步！射擊！瑟奇亞克再度開始獵殺——等等！瑪莉婭繞過了地面上的障礙，再度向瑟奇亞克發起了衝鋒——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克！瑟奇亞克壓根沒有挪步！是打算像剛才一樣硬接一劍嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"*警報聲*嘖！這該死的冷卻設計——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"不要得意忘形！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有弩手和劍盾騎士正面決戰的道理——這可是你說的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"（還沒有完成冷卻，必須先拉開距離！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克——！驚人的技巧！只靠弓弩刺刀竟然能做出如此完美的格擋！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪莉婭閉上了眼。\n過去無數次目睹過的這個動作，她只是在效仿，效仿著這個動作。\n效仿了很久很久。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......我想起來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個反手劍的動作......是瑪嘉烈奪冠那時的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塑膠騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_103","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這不可能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——誰、誰能想到這樣的結果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才還占儘先機的瑟奇亞克，竟然一劍——只被命中一劍就徹底失去了意識！毫無疑問，獲勝的是瑪莉婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這是怎麼做到的！難道就像那年奇蹟般的決賽一樣！瑪莉婭·臨光，隱藏了真實的實力嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯嚯，這不是做得挺好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"這就不看了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好看的，不如回去好好檢修自己的武器，別被人撿了漏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，說的也是呐，等等我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭......你真的做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這真的是好事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"莫布先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"（喂！這裡可是解說台！快下去！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，小聲些，可別讓觀眾們聽見了......這個位置觀眾是看不見我的，請放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是來轉達一些帕維爾先生的意見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"帕......你、你對總裁直呼其名......你想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"看來瑟奇亞克因為技藝不精而輸掉了競賽，白費了呼嘯守衛的期待，令人遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"噓......有些事情是怎麼回事，該說的，不該說的，您心裡清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，觀眾們在等著您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"各位——！各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"看現場的賠率和票數，這毫無疑問是一場大爆冷！這場比賽註定會成為這幾天的討論中心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有封號的獨立騎士戰勝了呼嘯騎士團的大先鋒！看來瑪莉婭·臨光的源石技藝不容小覷，她靠實力勝過了“塑膠”的瑟奇亞克！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是瑟奇亞克面對新人放鬆警惕了嗎？亦或是賽場上二人的交流內容決定了勝負？啊啊，我早說過要給騎士裝上麥克風——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"但——是！無論怎樣的藉口都已經晚了！本人榮幸地宣佈本日第一場賽事的結果！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"勝者是——瑪莉婭·臨光！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
